      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<p>1. And as for the firewood, it has reached [Minya] al-Qays, 30 loads at the price of</p>\n<p>2. 3 dirhams and \u00bc per load, and all of the remaining firewood</p>\n<p>3. was sent to Minb\u0101l, at the calculation of two dirhams per load. Let it be transported to the Nile.</p>\n<p>4. At the price of two dirhams (?)</p>\n<p>5. 10 loads were sent and the masters of the ships are protesting because the ships will get stuck in the mud [with all that weight]</p>\n<p>6. and when the water level rises, the ships will sail better. The rest, which was in [Minya] al-Qays has been sent(?)</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
